{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c0b8dfda-7416-82d0-8637-2d5d9ccef06f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T13:00:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:56:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I'm calling about the pothole patch on my street. Well, not the pothole, the patch. The patch is gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:56:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gone how? Let's start with where you are. What street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:56:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it was last Tuesday they came. No, wait, you asked the street. It's Spring Street. 384 Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:56:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "384 Spring, got it. And you said somebody patched it last week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:56:56-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A crew came and shoveled in that cold patch stuff, black gravel, tamped it down with the back of the truck, whatever they did. Lasted maybe five days. Then we had that rain and the freeze, and now it's washed right out. The hole's bigger than it was before, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:57:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, cold patch does that in winter, it doesn't bond great when it's wet and cold. Where's the hole, exactly? In front of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right out front, by the curb, on my side. Maybe two feet across. I drive a little Corolla and I've already gone through it once, and it rattled my teeth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:57:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two feet across, by the curb, in front of 384. Writing that down. Any chance you have a picture of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do, I took some of it when it was patched and then again this morning. I can send them. Or, well, I'd have to figure out how, I'm not great with the phone part. My neighbor could do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:58:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That'd help. I can give you an address to send them to if you want to hang on a sec, or I can just note that photos are available."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Note it for now. I'll get them sent. I'm not standing in the middle of the street holding the phone up again, I'll tell you that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:58:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, fair enough. Don't do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:58:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I mean, it's the second time I've had to call about this. Well, no, the first time it was the same hole, so yes, I guess the second. They fixed it, supposedly, and it didn't hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:58:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So what are you hoping for, a proper repair?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd like Spring Street added to the repair list. The real list, not a shovel and a prayer. When the weather lets them do it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can put it in as a repeat request and ask that it be looked at for a permanent fix. I can't tell you when. Crews go by what's on the list and the weather, and in February the asphalt plants are pretty limited."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what I figured. I've got to say, I budget carefully. I do the cash envelope thing for groceries, so when I wreck a tire, that's money out of the milk envelope. I'm not made of money."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T12:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I hear you. If the car does take damage there's a claim process, I can have someone tell you about that if you'd like. But let me finish the request first. Spring Street, 384, hole by the curb, earlier cold patch washed out, photos available. Is there a good number if the crew has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185, and the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Barbara Sherman. S-H-E-R-M-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Barbara. Okay, that's logged. Somebody should take another look, and I've flagged it as a repeat so it doesn't get treated like a brand new report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I appreciate that. I just don't want to be calling a third time in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hope you don't have to. Send those photos when your neighbor can, and if it gets worse, call us back and mention today's report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Okay. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T13:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care, Barbara."
    }
  ],
